# Replace addresses and credentials. Synthetic registration is for isolated testing only.
@algorithm_base_url = https://algorithm.example.test
@platform_base_url = https://platform.example.test
@algorithm_token = REPLACE_WITH_VALID_SIGNED_ALGORITHM_TOKEN
@platform_push_token = REPLACE_WITH_DEDICATED_PLATFORM_TOKEN

### Initialize activity
POST {{algorithm_base_url}}/v1/activities/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{algorithm_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/01-activity.json

### Bind cameras
POST {{algorithm_base_url}}/v1/activities/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{algorithm_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/02-bindings.json

### Enable activity
POST {{algorithm_base_url}}/v1/activities/monitoring
Authorization: Bearer {{algorithm_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/03-monitoring.json

### SYNTHETIC registration ONLY - use real prepared templates for real people
POST {{algorithm_base_url}}/v1/monitoring/persons
Authorization: Bearer {{algorithm_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/04-person.synthetic.json

### Platform receiver - initial event
POST {{platform_base_url}}/api-security/algorithm/person-track/events
Authorization: Bearer {{platform_push_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/05-track-upsert.json

### Platform receiver - identity correction
POST {{platform_base_url}}/api-security/algorithm/person-track/events
Authorization: Bearer {{platform_push_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/06-track-correction.json

### Platform receiver - retraction
POST {{platform_base_url}}/api-security/algorithm/person-track/events
Authorization: Bearer {{platform_push_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./examples/07-track-retract.json
